fray-relay-client
=================

This crate was moved from the `decented-signet` crate
(forgesworn/signet-play, revision d81ebacfed516fe9c20ffcedbe31ad7d61642491,
src/relay.rs), together with that crate's background-task handle and runtime
and the relay tests, by the same author, with only the changes needed to
stand alone: four items made public and the runtime's threads renamed. It is
distributed under the MIT License; see LICENSE.

Before that, the websocket worker pattern was ported from the rendezvous relay
client of an earlier game codebase by the same author, at source commit
bdd4fe877acf3a6f4ca3174d1ce79c6672935e2f, and rewritten for stored events and
NIP-01 filters.

